        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:680.5863037109375,848.9176025390625,3615.0411376953125,11238.709350585938",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "<p></p>\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">The slave</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\u02bfAbd al-B\u0101q\u012b ibn Ya\u1e25y\u0101 the Jew,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">who lives in Mal\u012bj.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">In the name of God, the merciful and compassionate.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">May God, the exalted, perpetuate the rule of the exalted and lofty seat, the mighty lord aI-Malik al-N\u0101\u1e63ir,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">uniter of the word of the faith, conqueror of the servants of the cross, Sal\u0101\u1e25 al-Duny\u0101 wa-al-D\u012bn,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">sultan of Islam and the Muslims, reviver of the dynasty of the commander of the faithful, and cause his power to endure</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and exalt his word. The slave kisses the ground and reports that he is a poor man</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">with a family and children, who makes his living among Muslims in Mal\u012bj in the province of al-Gharbiyya.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">He pays the capitation tax for which he is liable, and there is no one with whom he has bad relations. </li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Recently he has been damaged and afflicted by tax officials.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">They have summarily made him give up his livelihood, and forced him to work for them as a tax collector</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and an informant. There has been no precedent for this for sixty years.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">The justice of his lord should prevent his being caused damage and his being made to give up his livelihood. He asks</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">for the issuing of an exalted decree, may God increase its efficacy, to all the officials concerned with</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">the collection of the capitation tax in the province of al-Gharbiyya to release him, so that nothing will happen to him,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">and to treat his case with justice and impartiality,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">so that he may be able to live in his native town with his family and children. Let the exalted decree be deposited in his hand,</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">as a kindness and benefaction to him.</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">Praise be to God alone and his blessings be upon our lord Muhammad, his prophet, and save him.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
